# Personal Notion only

This project talks to a **personal** Notion account and workspace.

Never use a workspace listed in `catalog.json` → `notion.forbiddenWorkspaces`. Never use the Cursor MCP server named `notion` / `user-notion`.

Use only the project MCP server `notion-personal` after it is connected to the personal account.

If `notion-personal` is missing, unauthenticated, or still bound to the work workspace, stop. Do not create, update, or query pages in the work workspace as a fallback.
